<title>USA: Precision Castparts files for 4.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Precision Castparts files for 4.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Castparts Corp filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission Friday for up to 4.0 million common shres.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay bank debt and for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Morgan Stanley &amp; Co and Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. The underwriters have an overallotment option for up to 600,000 additional shares.</p>
</text>
